      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think it\u0027s clear why you do this at a glance. I think you should add a comment explaining why we\u0027re treating the memory allocation failure here as a duplicate.",
      "revId": "cb93b7f618c844e066415c8b99f37c4ae106744e",
